  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "Online stores need ads that count profit",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--cream\" aria-labelledby=\"h-322\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-322\">Online stores need ads <span class=\"accent\">that count profit</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Pick a problem to see how we fix it.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpvt cmvt\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpvt__list\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"eCommerce problems\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\"><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--1\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-321-t-roas\" aria-controls=\"bh-321-roas\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">01</i>Revenue up, profit down</b><span>Return on ad spend looks fine, but after product costs, shipping and returns, ads lose money.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--2\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-321-t-feed\" aria-controls=\"bh-321-feed\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">02</i>A feed that holds you back</b><span>Disapproved products, poor titles and missing data limit Shopping and Performance Max.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--3\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-321-t-track\" aria-controls=\"bh-321-track\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">03</i>Platforms claim the same sale</b><span>Google, Meta and TikTok all take credit, so total “sales” are far higher than your store.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"wpvt__tab cmvt__tab cmvt__tab--4\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bh-321-t-creative\" aria-controls=\"bh-321-creative\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b><i aria-hidden=\"true\">04</i>Ads that stopped selling</b><span>The same product photos everywhere, so costs rise.</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wpvt__panels\"><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--1\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-321-roas\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-321-t-roas\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>Return on ad spend looks fine, but after product costs, shipping and returns, ads lose money.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">Manage ads for profit, not revenue.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A 4× return can lose money on a low-margin product, and a 2× return can be very profitable on a high-margin one.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>Margins from your store and finance team</li><li>Targets for each product group</li><li>Budget moved to profitable products</li><li>Monthly profit report</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Growth only helps if it’s profitable.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Same 4× return</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>High-margin product</span><b>Profit</b></li><li><span>Low-margin product</span><b>Loss</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Margins by product</b><p>Real margins, after costs and returns.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Profit targets</b><p>A target return for each product group.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Margin-based campaigns</b><p>Best-margin products get the budget.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Profit reporting</b><p>Profit from ads, every month.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Profit targets</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Margin-based campaigns</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Profit reports</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--2\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-321-feed\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-321-t-feed\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>Disapproved products, poor titles and missing data limit Shopping and Performance Max.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">A product feed built to sell.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>On Google, the feed is the targeting.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>Errors fixed</li><li>Titles rewritten</li><li>Custom labels for campaigns</li><li>Weekly checks</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Better data, better Shopping results.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--calc\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Feed health</p><ul class=\"cmv__rows\" role=\"list\"><li><span>Approved</span><b>100%</b></li><li class=tot><span>Titles rewritten</span><b>840</b></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Feed fixes</b><p>Errors fixed and monitored.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Titles for search</b><p>Written around real searches.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Attributes</b><p>Sizes, colours and GTINs complete.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Supplemental feeds</b><p>Labels for margin and best-sellers.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> A clean feed</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Rewritten titles</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Custom labels</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--3\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-321-track\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-321-t-track\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>Google, Meta and TikTok all take credit, so total “sales” are far higher than your store.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">One version of the truth: your store.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>When every platform claims the sale, budgets go to the wrong place.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>Tracking through your store</li><li>Each platform checked</li><li>Reports from your store</li><li>New customers counted separately</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Spend follows real sales.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--bars\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Sales claimed</p><ul class=\"cmv__vb\" role=\"list\"><li style=\"--h:80%\"><b>96</b><span>Google</span></li><li style=\"--h:60%\"><b>71</b><span>Meta</span></li><li style=\"--h:92%\"><b>112</b><span>Store</span></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Server-side tracking</b><p>Purchases sent reliably to every platform.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>Deduplication</b><p>No double counting.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Store-based reporting</b><p>Revenue from Shopify or WooCommerce.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>New vs returning</b><p>Who’s really new.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Server-side tracking</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Store-based reports</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> New-customer split</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"wpvt__panel cmvt__panel cmvt__panel--4\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bh-321-creative\" aria-labelledby=\"bh-321-t-creative\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__prob\"><span>The challenge</span>The same product photos everywhere, so costs rise.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__kick\">Our approach</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"cmvt__h\">New creative every month, for every platform.</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__more\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__txt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>On social platforms, creative does most of the targeting.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">In practice</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmvt__bul\" role=\"list\"><li>New concepts monthly</li><li>Vertical video</li><li>Creator content</li><li>Tested properly</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__sub\">Why it matters</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Fresh ads keep costs down.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"cmvt__fig\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"cmv cmv--bars\"><p class=\"cmv__t\">Cost per sale</p><ul class=\"cmv__vb\" role=\"list\"><li style=\"--h:75%\"><b>$38</b><span>Static</span></li><li style=\"--h:55%\"><b>$29</b><span>Video</span></li><li style=\"--h:42%\"><b>$22</b><span>UGC</span></li></ul></div></figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"cmvt__label\">Methods we use</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol class=\"cmvt__ms\" role=\"list\"><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">1</span><b>Product video</b><p>Short videos for Reels and TikTok.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">2</span><b>UGC</b><p>Creators showing the product in use.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">3</span><b>Offers</b><p>Bundles and seasonal offers tested.</p></li><li class=\"cmvt__m\"><span class=\"cmvt__mn\">4</span><b>Catalogue ads</b><p>Dynamic ads with better templates.</p></li></ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmvt__get\"><p>What you get</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> New ads every month</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> UGC</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Catalogue templates</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "ecommerce-performance-marketing",
    "modules": [
     "@intella/tabs"
    ]
   }
