   "attrs": {
    "label": "Online stores we run ads for",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white cmwk2s\" aria-labelledby=\"h-327\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"h-327\">Online stores we <span class=\"accent\">run ads for</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Pick a store to see what we did.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2\" data-tabs>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"eCommerce clients\"><button class=\"cmwk2__tab cmwk2__tab--1\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bw-326-t-ferrow\" aria-controls=\"bw-326-ferrow\" aria-selected=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmlg\" style=\"--lc:#0f766e\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#14b8a6\"/><path d=\"M14 27V13h12M14 20h9\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"cmlg__w\"><b>Ferrow</b><span>Home</span></span></span><span class=\"cmwk2__ind\">eCommerce, homeware</span>\n\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"cmwk2__tab cmwk2__tab--2\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bw-326-t-packwise\" aria-controls=\"bw-326-packwise\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmlg\" style=\"--lc:#4338ca\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 4 34 12v16L20 36 6 28V12z\" fill=\"#6366f1\"/><path d=\"M6 12l14 8 14-8M20 20v16\" stroke=\"#c7d2fe\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\"/></svg><span class=\"cmlg__w\"><b>Packwise</b><span>Supplies</span></span></span><span class=\"cmwk2__ind\">Packaging, eCommerce and Amazon</span>\n\t\t\t\t</button><button class=\"cmwk2__tab cmwk2__tab--3\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"bw-326-t-orbitly\" aria-controls=\"bw-326-orbitly\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"cmlg\" style=\"--lc:#7c3aed\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\"/><ellipse cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c4b5fd\" stroke-width=\"3\" transform=\"rotate(-25 20 20)\"/></svg><span class=\"cmlg__w\"><b>Orbitly</b><span>Apps</span></span></span><span class=\"cmwk2__ind\">Consumer subscription brand</span>\n\t\t\t\t</button></div>\n\t\t\t\t<article class=\"cmwk2__panel cmwk2__panel--1\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bw-326-ferrow\" aria-labelledby=\"bw-326-t-ferrow\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<header class=\"cmwk2__head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Ferrow Home</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>eCommerce, homeware · 35 people · 14 months with us</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmwk2__tags\" role=\"list\"><li>Google Shopping</li><li>Meta Ads</li><li>Tracking</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t</header>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--why\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Why they came to us</p><p>Google Shopping and Meta were run by two freelancers, and both claimed the same sales.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--did\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The work we did</p><ul class=\"cmwk2__did\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> One plan across Google Shopping, Performance Max and Meta</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Server-side tracking and the Conversions API</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Product feed rebuilt in Merchant Center</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> New video ads every month</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--exp\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The outcome they wanted</p><p>Profitable growth they could trust, measured in Shopify, not in ad platforms.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__res\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Results achieved</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><b>3.9×</b><span>return on ad spend</span></li><li><b>+64%</b><span>online revenue</span></li><li><b>−31%</b><span>cost per sale</span></li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t</article><article class=\"cmwk2__panel cmwk2__panel--2\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bw-326-packwise\" aria-labelledby=\"bw-326-t-packwise\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<header class=\"cmwk2__head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Packwise Supplies</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Packaging, eCommerce and Amazon · 50 people · 12 months with us</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmwk2__tags\" role=\"list\"><li>Amazon Ads</li><li>Google Shopping</li><li>Microsoft Ads</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t</header>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--why\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Why they came to us</p><p>Amazon sales were growing, but advertising ate most of the margin.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--did\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The work we did</p><ul class=\"cmwk2__did\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Amazon Sponsored Products restructured by margin</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Google Shopping for the website</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Microsoft Ads for business buyers</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> One report across all three</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--exp\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The outcome they wanted</p><p>More profitable sales on Amazon and their own site.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__res\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Results achieved</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><b>−36%</b><span>Amazon advertising cost of sales</span></li><li><b>+48%</b><span>website revenue</span></li><li><b>3</b><span>platforms, one report</span></li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t</article><article class=\"cmwk2__panel cmwk2__panel--3\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"bw-326-orbitly\" aria-labelledby=\"bw-326-t-orbitly\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>\n\t\t\t\t\t<header class=\"cmwk2__head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Orbitly Apps</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Consumer subscription brand · 25 people · 8 months with us</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"cmwk2__tags\" role=\"list\"><li>TikTok Ads</li><li>Creative</li><li>Tracking</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t</header>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__grid\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--why\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Why they came to us</p><p>TikTok drove views but very few trials, and they couldn’t tell which videos worked.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--did\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The work we did</p><ul class=\"cmwk2__did\" role=\"list\"><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> TikTok Pixel and Events API</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Spark ads with creators</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Weekly creative tests</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg> Meta remarketing for engaged viewers</li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__col cmwk2__col--exp\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">The outcome they wanted</p><p>Trials at a cost that made the subscription profitable.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"cmwk2__res\"><p class=\"cmwk2__k\">Results achieved</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><b>−58%</b><span>cost per trial</span></li><li><b>42</b><span>videos tested</span></li><li><b>2.7×</b><span>trials per month</span></li></ul></div>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "ecommerce-performance-marketing",
    "modules": [
     "@intella/tabs"
    ]
   }
